{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/815a2143d4c1fa940c0398fa0af231b0.avif?t=1759421405\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pungo</strong> is a fun PvP (player versus player) game, perfect for sharing and challenging friends. Inspired by the classic Pong, it adds a twist with adorable playable cats, original power-ups, and innovative levels full of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each kitten has its own mix of abilities, unique stats, and distinct playstyles \u2014 try different combinations and find your best strategy to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headbutt, belly-flop, or kick to charge energy and unleash super moves to dominate the field! Be the fastest kitten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends, organize tournaments, and become the most victorious cat. Scratch mystery boxes, unlock new characters, discover their stories, and complete your collection in the adorable world of <strong>Pungo</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603010?t=1759421405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/d0f55e6fec2fc46475e54cb935f0c25093ad0355/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759421405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/116c66536bd0f4aea2786c4687a30f0b2f4e576d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759421405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/116c66536bd0f4aea2786c4687a30f0b2f4e576d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759421405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},